glish", "review": "absolutely goated game, the story is amazing, the sound impeccable, the voice acting couldn't be better. The 102 levels of fun, and even if you finish each and every one, you can play online either with friends, or strangers if you want to make some. The weapon design on both the player and the enemies are awesome. 4 classes each with their own unique skills and weapons. it took me 50 hours to beat the main story, and that's with the air raider. you could easily spend 300 hours if you grind all the characters, weapons, and difficulties. you don't need some specialty hardware to run this game, it can be run off of an xbox 360 if it was released on it. If you don't want to spend 60$ for this game, absolutely try out \"Earth Defense Force 2025\" (it was not, in fact, released in 2025 but actually 2015). any of the games from this series is goated.\r\n\r\nHowever, not every good review is just good. The lighting can be sometimes blinding, preventing you from properly seeing and shooting. Explosions are exaggerated and also can prevent you from shooting properly. the weapon grind is awful and you have to spend time on previous levels to pray, just pray that you get lucky and a weapon box holds what you need/want. health boxes are sometimes too abundant or few and far between. \r\n\r\nOverall, the game is amazing and if you have the money absolutely buy the game. It could use some polishing but, you can always try again.", "timestamp_created": 1750121437, "timestamp_updated": 1750121437, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}